WEBVTT

00:09:59.625 --> 00:10:02.643
Planning how we want to
take over the world soon

00:10:02.667 --> 00:10:06.726
Riding on the drums and the clap
while the bass goes boom

00:10:06.750 --> 00:10:09.393
Shake it down shake it down like

00:10:09.417 --> 00:10:12.018
Wait till you, wait till you see my

00:10:12.042 --> 00:10:14.583
Hey! Shake it down shake it down like

00:10:15.417 --> 00:10:17.750
Wait till you, wait till you see my

00:10:19.333 --> 00:10:21.768
If you really know it
and you really wanna show it

00:10:21.792 --> 00:10:25.101
Be the way to go

00:10:25.125 --> 00:10:27.726
Go and grab somebody,
move your body, show somebody

00:10:27.750 --> 00:10:31.684
Be the way to go